--           through SQVI/Materiales joins naturally
--   Step 4: stg_gd_cuota_agg removed. Esqueleto still created for GAPs Step 6.
--   Step 6: Simplified - no separate cuota-only UNION needed (6b/6c removed)
-- ============================================================================
